# Local attachment storage. Never bake a developer's uploads into the image —
# in production this path is a mounted volume anyway.
uploads

# Repo furniture with no role in the build. The runtime image does `COPY . .`
# so that the worker (tsx) and scripts/migrate.ts have real source to run,
# which means anything left here ships to everyone who pulls the image.
#
# docs/ and the root *.md files deliberately stay IN the context: Tailwind
# scans the project for class names and app/globals.css negates docs/ with
# `@source not "../docs/**"`, so removing them would change what the CSS build
# sees for no real gain.
